  "description": "This security gate features a single folding design with a retractable structure, providing versatility and adaptability. The gate expands to 50\" in height and 75\" in width, offering comprehensive coverage for entrances and doorways.\nFeatures\nEnlarged Size:YITAMOTOR single security gate has 75\" wide. Under the same conditions, the larger extension size is more suitable for courtyards, garages, warehouses and other scenes\nSingle Folding Door Gate: YITAMOTOR folding security gate presents a single folding design with a retractable door, offering versatility and adaptability; The accordion security gate expands to 50\" height and 75\" width, providing comprehensive coverage for entrances and doorways.The standard size is suitable for use as safety doors, barricade gates seeking protection and defend.\nDurable Construction: The flexible expanding security gate is crafted from heavy-duty 3/4\" 22 gauge channel steel with powder finish, ensuring durability and longevity; The unique non-interference design effectively safeguards your property and prevents unwanted intrusions\n360°Rolling Casters: This scissor gate is equipped with 2 rolling casters at the bottom, allowing the gate to swing up to 360 degrees; The casters also feature a lock design to fix the gate's position, ensuring both mobility and stability\nAluminium Alloy Mesh and Anti-Theft Bolts: The side folding gate incorporates an aluminum alloy mesh with 22 3/4\" square tubes, offering lightweight yet robust protection; The fence security gate is secured with anti-theft bolts, enhancing the gate's security features",
